OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police station to be
OL,4,Aconverted into homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's first police stations
OL,7,Fis set to be transformed into 13
OL,8,Faffordable homes.
OL,10,FThe former Prescot Police Station and
OL,11,Flaw courts on Darby Street, which
OL,12,Fopened in 1870, have been derelict
OL,13,Fsince 2011.
OL,15,FNow, housing association Prima Group's
OL,16,Fproject will see the site converted
OL,17,Finto 13 shared ownership homes,
OL,18,Fincluding apartments, bungalows and
OL,19,Fhouses.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
